   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Liabilities with «-s»",
   "texto": [
    "The passive with **-s** is common in formal rules and texts: **Lønn utbetales hver måned** («The salary is paid every month»). The agent is usually omitted."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Liabilities with «bli»",
   "texto": [
    "****Bli + participio** presents an action or a change: **Timene blir registrert** («The hours are recorded»). In bokmål, **registrert** does not change by the plural of **timene**: the same form of the participle is maintained."
   ]
  },
